      "seed": 8029866,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 106195206,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "PK  orderId   (= partner Idempotency-Key)\n    status  PENDING -> WMS_SENT -> COMPLETED / FAILED\n    payloadHash (canonicalised) | lockExpiresAt | ttl 7d\n\nclaim:  attribute_not_exists(orderId)\n     OR status = FAILED\n     OR (status = PENDING AND lockExpiresAt < now)\n\n~400 WCU, not 8,000 -- writes happen at CONSUMER rate.\nThe queue absorbs the spike; the DB never sees it.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PK  orderId   (= partner Idempotency-Key)\n    status  PENDING -> WMS_SENT -> COMPLETED / FAILED\n    payloadHash (canonicalised) | lockExpiresAt | ttl 7d\n\nclaim:  attribute_not_exists(orderId)\n     OR status = FAILED\n     OR (status = PENDING AND lockExpiresAt < now)\n\n~400 WCU, not 8,000 -- writes happen at CONSUMER rate.\nThe queue absorbs the spike; the DB never sees it.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
