    {
      "id": "el1038",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 508.0,
      "y": 679.75,
      "width": 436.8,
      "height": 162.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8219922,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 108708702,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "* WAF\n* API key + usage plan -> PER-PARTNER throttle\n* Request validator (JSON Schema) -> 400, no compute\n* DIRECT SQS service integration -- NO validator Lambda\n  (no cold start, no ~640-concurrency problem, 1/3 cost)\n* Lambda authorizer WITH cache TTL 300 s\n  (uncached, the authorizer IS the bottleneck at 8k rps)\n* account quota ~10k rps / 5k burst, REGION-WIDE\n  -> raise it BEFORE the flash sale, not during\n* payload > 10 MB -> 413, use presigned S3 + send key",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* WAF\n* API key + usage plan -> PER-PARTNER throttle\n* Request validator (JSON Schema) -> 400, no compute\n* DIRECT SQS service integration -- NO validator Lambda\n  (no cold start, no ~640-concurrency problem, 1/3 cost)\n* Lambda authorizer WITH cache TTL 300 s\n  (uncached, the authorizer IS the bottleneck at 8k rps)\n* account quota ~10k rps / 5k burst, REGION-WIDE\n  -> raise it BEFORE the flash sale, not during\n* payload > 10 MB -> 413, use presigned S3 + send key",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el1040",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040.0,
      "y": 679.75,
      "width": 444.59999999999997,
      "height": 81.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8235760,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 108918160,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "DeduplicationScope   = messageGroup      <- BOTH\nFifoThroughputLimit  = perMessageGroupId    required\nMessageGroupId       = customerId\nMessageDedupId       = Idempotency-Key (5 min free dedup)\nretention 14 d | visibilityTimeout 300 s | maxReceive 5",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DeduplicationScope   = messageGroup      <- BOTH\nFifoThroughputLimit  = perMessageGroupId    required\nMessageGroupId       = customerId\nMessageDedupId       = Idempotency-Key (5 min free dedup)\nretention 14 d | visibilityTimeout 300 s | maxReceive 5",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el1042",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040.0,
      "y": 814.75,
      "width": 382.2,
      "height": 48.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8251598,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 109127618,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "!! ApproximateAgeOfOldestMessage  is THE metric.\n   Alarm > 15 min. Detects stalled groups AND\n   a stalled consumer. Nothing else catches both.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "!! ApproximateAgeOfOldestMessage  is THE metric.\n   Alarm > 15 min. Detects stalled groups AND\n   a stalled consumer. Nothing else catches both.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el1044",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1572.0,
      "y": 679.75,
      "width": 452.4,
      "height": 130.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8267436,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 109337076,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "ESM: batchSize 10 | MaximumConcurrency 45\n     FunctionResponseTypes = ReportBatchItemFailures\n     (not optional -- without it 1 bad msg retries all 10)\nlambdaTimeout 40 s | wmsCallTimeout 3 s\n\nFIFO partial-failure semantics: a reported failure also\nfails the REST of that message group (preserves order).\nOther groups in the same batch still commit.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ESM: batchSize 10 | MaximumConcurrency 45\n     FunctionResponseTypes = ReportBatchItemFailures\n     (not optional -- without it 1 bad msg retries all 10)\nlambdaTimeout 40 s | wmsCallTimeout 3 s\n\nFIFO partial-failure semantics: a reported failure also\nfails the REST of that message group (preserves order).\nOther groups in the same batch still commit.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
