      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "CONSUMER ERROR HANDLING  —  the poison-pill fix",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CONSUMER ERROR HANDLING  —  the poison-pill fix",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el1112",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 93.6,
      "y": 963.85,
      "width": 537.6,
      "height": 315.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8805928,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 116458648,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "try {\n    process(order);\n} catch (PermanentException e) {    // bad SKU, unknown customer\n    ddb.markFailed(orderId, e);\n    events.publishRejection(orderId, e);\n    // return SUCCESS -> delete msg, UNBLOCK THE GROUP NOW\n} catch (TransientException e) {    // WMS 5xx, DDB throttle\n    failures.add(messageId);        // let SQS retry\n}\nreturn new SQSBatchResponse(failures);\n\nPermanent failures must not burn 5 receives.\nBlind `throw` on every error = 25 min head-of-line block\nfor that customer (5 receives x 300 s VT).\n\nHead-of-line blocking itself is CORRECT -- it is the\nordering requirement being enforced. Detect it fast,\ndo not engineer around it.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "try {\n    process(order);\n} catch (PermanentException e) {    // bad SKU, unknown customer\n    ddb.markFailed(orderId, e);\n    events.publishRejection(orderId, e);\n    // return SUCCESS -> delete msg, UNBLOCK THE GROUP NOW\n} catch (TransientException e) {    // WMS 5xx, DDB throttle\n    failures.add(messageId);        // let SQS retry\n}\nreturn new SQSBatchResponse(failures);\n\nPermanent failures must not burn 5 receives.\nBlind `throw` on every error = 25 min head-of-line block\nfor that customer (5 receives x 300 s VT).\n\nHead-of-line blocking itself is CORRECT -- it is the\nordering requirement being enforced. Detect it fast,\ndo not engineer around it.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el1114",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 984.0,
